                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with this conviction fights, if it made a charge move, was charged or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, add 1 to that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
                          </characteristics>
