                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time a unit with this conviction is selected to shoot or fight, you can re-roll one hit roll or one wound roll when resolving that unit’s attacks.</characteristic>
