      <profiles>
        <profile name="Solemn Procession" id="ca4a-fd71-7b33-9edd" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model cannot embark aboard a TRANSPORT. For the purposes of the Look Out, Sir rule and any terrain traits (e.g. Dense Cover, Obscuring etc.), this model is considered to have a Wounds characteristic of 9, instead of 18.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Relics of the Matriarchs:" id="713e-32bf-8369-e848" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This model has a number of Relics of the Matriarchs, that depends of the Model&apos;s Wound table.
- With 10+ Wounds Remaining, all 6 Relics are active.
- With 5-9 Wounds Remaining, up to 4 Relics are active 
- With 1-4 Wounds Remaining, up to 2 Relics are active 
When this model suffers damage that reduces its number of relics, select which of the Relics of the Matriarchs this model no longer has. If this model regains lost wounds that increase its number of Relics of the Matriarchs, select which of the Relics of the Matriarchs this model regains.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Triumph of Saint Katherine [1] (10+ Wounds remaining)" id="3487-f1e6-a7f1-0124" hidden="false" typeId="800f-21d0-4387-c943" typeName="Model">
