                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While an enemy unit is within 6&quot; of this model, at the start of your Shooting phase, roll one D6 for that unit, adding 1 to the result if that enemy unit is a PSYKER, and adding 1 to the result if that enemy unit has the CHAOS keyword (these additions are cumulative): on a 5+, that enemy unit suffers D3 mortal wounds.</characteristic>
