            <profile name="Unbridled Ardour" id="2392-e965-06d0-f926" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Each time an attack with a Damage characteristic of 1 is allocated to AESTRED THURGA, add 1 to any armour saving throw made against that attack.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Auto-Tapestry of the Emperor’s Judgement [Aura]" id="1422-aa4b-4af9-53ec" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, in your Command phase, AESTRED THURGA can plant this banner. If she does, until the start of your next Command phase, while a friendly ADEPTA SORORITAS CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, all 6 sacred rites are active for that unit.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
