          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Select one friendly IMPERIUM INFANTRY unit that is not at its Starting Strength and is within 3&quot; of that HOSPITALLER unit. One of the selected friendly unit’s destroyed models is returned to its unit with it&apos;s full wounds remaining.</characteristic>
