          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly IMPERIUM INFANTRY unit is within 3&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 6, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Sacred Healing" id="7ed8-32c5-06b3-df0b" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can heal one friendly IMPERIUM INFANTRY model whose unit is within 3&quot; of it. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be healed once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
