                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly &lt;ORDER&gt; CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, add 1 to the Strength characteristic of models in that unit.</characteristic>
