                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per battle, this unit are eligible to declare a charge in a turn in which has Advanced, and, until the end of the turn, each time a charge roll is made for this unit, roll one additional D6 and discard one of the results.</characteristic>
