          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the start of the first battle round, before the first turn begins, this unit, or the ADEPTUS SORORITAS TRANSPORT it is embarked within, can make a Normal Move of up to 6&quot; as if it were your Movement phase. This unit must end that move more than 9&quot; away from any enemy models. If both players have units that can do this, the player who is taking the first turn moves their units first.</characteristic>
