        <profile name="Awaken the Machine" id="c468-d6ba-9c62-23f3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">In your Command phase, this model can awaken one friendly IMPERIUM VEHICLE model within 3&quot; of it. 
Until the start of your next Command phase, each time that model loses a wound, roll a D6, on a 6+ the wound is not lost.
If the model already has a similar ability, add 1 to said roll.
Each model can only be awakened once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Master of Machines" id="909b-6c77-059a-54af" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can repair one friendly &lt;FORGE WORLD&gt; model or a friendly IMPERIUM VEHICLE model within 3&quot; of it. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be repaired once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
