              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">- Each time this WARLORD performs an Act of Faith, it regains 1 lost wound.
- Each time this WARLORD would lose a wound, roll one D6: on a 5+, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
